    <div class="content-wrapper">
        <div class="box">
            <h2>Algoritma BFS</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Mulai dari node awal, enqueue</li>
                <li>Selama queue tidak kosong:
                    <ul>
                        <li>dequeue node terdepan</li>
                        <li>Proses node tersebut</li>
                        <li>enqueue semua tetangga yang belum dikunjungi</li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
                <li>Menjamin jalur terpendek (graf tanpa bobot)</li>
                <li>Queue memastikan level demi level</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="code-box">
bfs.py
def bfs(graph, start):
    visited = set()
    queue = Queue()
    queue.enqueue(start)
    visited.add(start)

    while not queue.isEmpty():
        node = queue.dequeue()
        print(node) # proses

        for neighbor in graph[node]:
            if neighbor not in visited:
                visited.add(neighbor)
                queue.enqueue(neighbor)</div>
